Package: OraCol
Type: Package
Title: Summarise Oral Bacteria in Metagenomic Species Tables
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Cong", "Pham", email = "pham0323@flinders.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
URL: https://github.com/Cong34/OraCol
Description: Identifies oral bacterial species in a metagenomic species
    abundance table using curated oral taxa lists (HOMD, OES, mBodyMap) and
    returns per-species and per-sample summaries of oral bacteria, including
    relative abundance, prevalence, centred log-ratio (CLR) values, richness
    and Shannon diversity.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Imports:
    stats,
    TaxSEA
